# An allowlist: everything is left out, then each path an image needs is let
# back in, so a new file never reaches an image by accident.
*

# The lockfiles and manifests.
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!services/*/package.json

# The API's code and the SPA's sources.
!services/api/app
!services/web/index.html
!services/web/vite.config.ts
!services/web/tsconfig*.json
!services/web/src
!services/web/public

# Inside what is let back in.
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
